  "description": "The legendary SEIBU KAIHATSU arcade game Raiden Fighters 2 returns, revived from the depths of time.\n\nChoose between the Japanese version and a hardcore International version!\n\nEnjoy convenient features like rapid-fire button configuration, Practice Mode, and a restart function. Great for both first-time players and those returning to 2D shooting games after a long break!\n\nThe remix soundtrack includes all stage and boss music from Raiden Fighters 2.\n\nEnjoy the music on the sound player, and assign music to each stage just as you like with a mode.\n\nCustomize the experience to your liking and discover a new world of Raiden Fighters 2!\nParticipating Artist: KAZUHIRO TSURUKUBO\n\nCheck out the wallpaper customization, an authentic arcade-style CRT filter, and Vertical Screen Mode (monitor rotation) that deliver a vivid sense of presence that goes beyond the arcade experience.\n\nPlay the reborn Raiden Fighters 2 in its bold new form to your heart's content!\n\n■ Contents (Choose between the Japanese/International Version)\nRAIDEN FIGHTERS 2\n\n※ This product contains and offers selected titles from the RAIDEN FIGHTERS REMIX COLLECTION at a reduced price. Please be careful to avoid duplicate purchases.\n",
